1
00:00:16,239 --> 00:00:18,100
The mountains are covered in red.

2
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:20,540
Autumn leaves fall slowly,

3
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:24,720
like the most beautiful flowers,

4
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:27,640
gradually fading away,

5
00:00:29,740 --> 00:00:31,400
and forgotten by the world.

6
00:00:33,340 --> 00:00:35,040
It seems sorrowful,

7
00:00:47,540 --> 00:00:48,660
but it is not.

8
00:00:50,440 --> 00:00:52,100
It's not what you think.

9
00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:54,100
The moment of nirvana

10
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:56,440
is just like this.

11
00:01:44,039 --> 00:01:44,840
Are you okay?

12
00:01:45,440 --> 00:01:47,000
Are you trying to kill me?

13
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:49,340
You're the one trying to kill me.

14
00:01:49,340 --> 00:01:50,840
I told you we only had two minutes.

15
00:01:50,840 --> 00:01:51,840
What took you so long?

16
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:53,440
I was going as fast as I could.

17
00:01:53,800 --> 00:01:54,780
If you thought I was slow,

18
00:01:54,780 --> 00:01:56,310
why didn't you come help me?

19
00:01:57,140 --> 00:01:58,080
Are you okay?

20
00:02:08,039 --> 00:02:10,240
This is the daughter you raised, right?

21
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:11,940
Please calm down.

22
00:02:12,840 --> 00:02:15,340
This girl is usually quite gentle.

23
00:02:15,340 --> 00:02:16,380
Gentle?

24
00:02:17,280 --> 00:02:18,880
You call that gentle?

25
00:02:18,880 --> 00:02:20,480
She just doesn't know what's good for her.

26
00:02:20,480 --> 00:02:22,540
If it were in the past, I would have...

27
00:02:22,760 --> 00:02:24,079
What is that guy doing?

28
00:02:24,079 --> 00:02:25,210
Who is he talking to?

29
00:02:25,380 --> 00:02:26,420
Is he crazy?

30
00:02:26,579 --> 00:02:27,320
I'm sorry.

31
00:02:27,940 --> 00:02:30,200
I apologize to you on her behalf.

32
00:02:30,880 --> 00:02:31,840
This girl...

33
00:02:32,140 --> 00:02:33,200
She's been under a lot of pressure lately.

34
00:02:33,200 --> 00:02:35,400
When have I ever been treated like this?

35
00:02:37,040 --> 00:02:37,980
Stop staring.

36
00:02:39,280 --> 00:02:40,480
What do you want to do?

37
00:02:41,140 --> 00:02:42,880
I shouldn't have meddled in your business.

38
00:02:42,880 --> 00:02:43,940
Don't.

39
00:02:46,140 --> 00:02:48,240
She's just a kid and doesn't know better.

40
00:02:48,240 --> 00:02:50,079
We've already made a deal.

41
00:02:50,579 --> 00:02:53,640
Don't tell me you don't want this opportunity anymore.

42
00:02:53,740 --> 00:02:55,000
If you don't want it...

43
00:02:55,480 --> 00:02:56,740
I'll take it back.

44
00:03:01,480 --> 00:03:02,810
Are you threatening me?

45
00:03:03,020 --> 00:03:05,280
No.

46
00:03:09,600 --> 00:03:11,600
We've already taken the first step.

47
00:03:11,880 --> 00:03:13,810
Things are going pretty smoothly.

48
00:03:14,340 --> 00:03:15,520
My girl...

49
00:03:15,680 --> 00:03:17,200
She's a reasonable child.

50
00:03:17,800 --> 00:03:20,160
Please be a little more patient with her.

51
00:03:21,780 --> 00:03:23,040
Sorry for the trouble.

52
00:03:24,140 --> 00:03:25,280
Just this once.

53
00:03:28,600 --> 00:03:29,840
You are completely soaked.

54
00:03:29,840 --> 00:03:31,000
Do you need to change?

55
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:31,860
Leave me alone.

56
00:03:31,860 --> 00:03:32,780
Why is it completely dry?

57
00:03:32,780 --> 00:03:35,280
The lawsuit between Lingze and Mucheng is held as scheduled.

58
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:38,079
This time, I decided to let nature take its course.

59
00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:41,600
Let's see which direction things will go.

60
00:03:46,240 --> 00:03:46,900
Your Honor.

61
00:03:47,340 --> 00:03:49,440
Ling's Media has not breached the contract.

62
00:03:49,440 --> 00:03:51,600
If Mucheng unilaterally insists on terminating the contract,

63
00:03:51,600 --> 00:03:53,100
then according to the contract terms,

64
00:03:53,100 --> 00:03:55,500
it will be considered a breach of contract.

65
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:56,600
Plaintiff.

66
00:03:57,000 --> 00:04:00,530
Did Shengli Media commit any breach of contract or violations?

67
00:04:07,440 --> 00:04:08,240
No.

68
00:04:10,180 --> 00:04:10,900
Defendant.

69
00:04:11,240 --> 00:04:14,700
Are you willing to negotiate a settlement with the plaintiff?

70
00:04:18,380 --> 00:04:21,040
We agree to negotiate a settlement privately with the plaintiff.

71
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:22,940
I declare the court adjourned.

72
00:04:34,240 --> 00:04:34,840
Mr. Ling.

73
00:04:34,840 --> 00:04:35,440
Please make way.

74
00:04:35,440 --> 00:04:37,440
Will you really negotiate the contract termination with Mu Cheng?

75
00:04:37,440 --> 00:04:38,680
Mr. Ling, please say a few words.

76
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:39,480
Please make way.

77
00:04:39,480 --> 00:04:40,040
Mr. Ling.

78
00:04:40,480 --> 00:04:41,000
Please make way, everyone.

79
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:42,200
Without my help,

80
00:04:42,740 --> 00:04:44,300
Mu Cheng wouldn't dare to publicly report

81
00:04:44,300 --> 00:04:45,300
Ling Ze's crimes.

82
00:04:45,680 --> 00:04:47,610
She didn't have the guts after all.

83
00:04:48,280 --> 00:04:50,610
I should have guessed she would betray me.

84
00:04:50,840 --> 00:04:52,840
I can't count on others this time.

85
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:54,570
I must hold strong evidence

86
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:56,480
in my own hands.

87
00:04:57,580 --> 00:04:59,740
What are you going to do next?

88
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:07,040
Why aren't you talking?

89
00:05:10,340 --> 00:05:12,140
What exactly are you going to do?

90
00:05:20,180 --> 00:05:21,240
What are you doing?

91
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:28,880
I admit there are some misunderstandings between us.

92
00:05:29,980 --> 00:05:30,800
How about this?

93
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:31,930
You apologize to me,

94
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:33,440
and we'll let this go.

95
00:05:34,740 --> 00:05:36,180
Are you sick in the head?

96
00:05:36,180 --> 00:05:37,310
Me apologize to you?

97
00:05:37,640 --> 00:05:39,540
I almost drowned trying to save you.

98
00:05:39,540 --> 00:05:41,080
Your mission is to protect me,

99
00:05:41,080 --> 00:05:42,440
but you almost got me killed.

100
00:05:42,440 --> 00:05:43,880
And you want me to apologize to you?

101
00:05:43,880 --> 00:05:44,680
No,

102
00:05:45,080 --> 00:05:46,140
why are you so...

103
00:05:53,440 --> 00:05:54,240
Fine.

104
00:05:54,980 --> 00:05:55,920
I was wrong.

105
00:05:56,380 --> 00:05:58,310
I apologize. It was my negligence.

106
00:05:58,640 --> 00:05:59,500
Is that enough?

107
00:06:15,580 --> 00:06:16,710
Get in the car first.

108
00:06:39,340 --> 00:06:41,000
Forget it if you don't want to.

109
00:07:03,180 --> 00:07:05,380
As long as you return the contract to me,

110
00:07:05,580 --> 00:07:08,440
I will immediately destroy all the evidence I have.

111
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:10,060
I promise

112
00:07:10,580 --> 00:07:12,100
I won't let anyone know.

113
00:07:12,880 --> 00:07:14,880
I will also personally step forward

114
00:07:15,480 --> 00:07:18,410
to solve all the company's public opinion problems.

115
00:07:18,680 --> 00:07:19,480
How about it?

116
00:07:22,140 --> 00:07:22,940
Mucheng.

117
00:07:24,540 --> 00:07:26,870
You seem to have some misunderstandings.

118
00:07:27,440 --> 00:07:29,970
It's not about whether you want to help me now,

119
00:07:30,440 --> 00:07:32,100
but whether I want to save you.

120
00:07:53,440 --> 00:07:54,970
Ling Ze, are you even human?

121
00:07:56,780 --> 00:07:58,140
What do you take me for?

122
00:08:09,380 --> 00:08:10,180
Mr. Ling.

123
00:08:13,980 --> 00:08:15,910
Mr. Ling, I'm begging you, please.

124
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:19,340
I've done so much for the company.

125
00:08:20,340 --> 00:08:21,940
You can't treat me like this.

126
00:08:30,780 --> 00:08:31,580
Mucheng,

127
00:08:32,400 --> 00:08:33,760
everything you have

128
00:08:34,860 --> 00:08:36,600
was given to you by the company.

129
00:08:38,400 --> 00:08:40,730
How could you go behind the company's back

130
00:08:41,679 --> 00:08:42,809
and do these things?

131
00:08:44,039 --> 00:08:44,840
Mr. Ling,

132
00:08:45,800 --> 00:08:46,600
I promise

133
00:08:47,840 --> 00:08:49,660
I will never dare to do it again.

134
00:08:54,680 --> 00:08:56,280
You can't forget your roots.

135
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:02,340
Think about when you were in debt before.

136
00:09:04,240 --> 00:09:06,040
Think about who helped you then.

137
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:10,640
Actually, you only have a one-year contract left.

138
00:09:10,940 --> 00:09:13,140
As long as you are as obedient as before,

139
00:09:15,840 --> 00:09:16,840
I promise you

140
00:09:18,580 --> 00:09:20,680
I will definitely destroy this evidence

141
00:09:20,680 --> 00:09:22,200
and won't let anyone know.

142
00:09:23,740 --> 00:09:24,540
How about it?

143
00:09:32,440 --> 00:09:33,240
Okay.

144
00:09:36,780 --> 00:09:38,440
Go back and get some good rest.

145
00:09:38,780 --> 00:09:40,310
There's new work coming up.

146
00:09:57,880 --> 00:09:58,520
Mr. Ling,

147
00:09:59,140 --> 00:10:01,870
are we really going to include her in the new plan?

148
00:10:03,240 --> 00:10:04,040
Of course.

149
00:10:06,340 --> 00:10:06,960
Have you

150
00:10:07,780 --> 00:10:09,140
forgiven her?

151
00:10:13,140 --> 00:10:14,870
A dog that has bitten its master

152
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:17,680
can never be forgiven.

153
00:10:22,880 --> 00:10:24,340
What is that guy holding?

154
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:25,980
That guy?

155
00:10:27,840 --> 00:10:28,640
That person.

156
00:10:31,080 --> 00:10:33,080
This is evidence forged in advance.

157
00:10:33,080 --> 00:10:35,840
Trying to manipulate others with forged evidence.

158
00:10:35,840 --> 00:10:37,970
He is truly a wolf in sheep's clothing.

159
00:10:40,140 --> 00:10:42,700
Do you... Do you always speak so...

160
00:10:44,840 --> 00:10:46,880
Do you always speak so formally?

161
00:10:48,180 --> 00:10:48,980
Why?

162
00:10:50,740 --> 00:10:51,540
Nothing.

163
00:10:54,580 --> 00:10:56,140
What's your plan next?

164
00:10:57,980 --> 00:11:01,240
Next, we need to pay closer attention to Lingze's actions.

165
00:11:01,440 --> 00:11:04,000
At the same time, we must take the initiative.

166
00:11:04,780 --> 00:11:06,310
How to take the initiative?

167
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:10,600
We have to learn from this.
